	This is a beautiful coral beach.
Fine silver sand kissed lightly by warm tropical waters and illuminated
by a huge tropical moon stretches at least 30 meters inland.
Gently swaying palm trees are left.

>-: Dew lit sunbeams stretch out from a watery sunrise and herald the dawn.
You awake from a misty dream-world into stark reality.
It is day.

	You are among palm trees near the shore.
Arching coconut palms laden with fruit provide a canopy for the glistening
white sand and sparse grasses growing here. The forest grows denser ahead.
The ocean is behind you.

>-: It is just after sunrise.
